### Automatic Renewal

* Unless you cancel before the renewal date, subscriptions automatically renew at the end of each billing period (for example, monthly or annually, based on the plan you selected) at the then-current price, and your payment method is charged automatically.  
* You can turn off automatic renewal at any time: for direct (web) subscriptions in your Secria account settings or by contacting us; for App Store or Google Play purchases, through your Apple or Google account subscription settings.  
* We will provide advance notice of any price change before it takes effect, as required by applicable law and app-store rules.

### Cancellation Policy

* If you choose to cancel your subscription, the cancellation will take effect at the end of your current billing cycle, and you will retain access to the subscribed features until that time.  
* After the current billing cycle concludes, your subscription will not renew, and you will lose access to any premium features.  
* Failure to fulfill payment obligations may result in restricted access to premium features or account suspension.

### Refunds and 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee

* Direct purchases (Web & Android via Stripe): New subscribers may request a full refund within 30 days of their first subscription purchase by contacting us at hq@secria.me. This 30-day money-back guarantee applies once per customer, to your initial subscription purchase only, and does not apply to renewals or subsequent purchases.  
